        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>concerned with measurement</i>: -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), ἡ, <i>mensuration</i>, 
